  mg/day showed a significant advantage over placebo as early as 1 hour postdose on SKAMP-Combined scores (p < 0.001).  
  When analyzing the entire sample of 54 children, d-MPH-ER maintained significant superiority over placebo from hours  
  1 through 12 (p-values ranged from < 0.001 to 0.046). D-MPH-ER was well tolerated, with no severe AEs reported.       
