"Stimulant medication effects in a summer treatment program among young children with attention-deficit/hyperactivity 
disorder", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE This study examined the effectiveness of stimulant medication on multiple domains of 
functioning in 36 young (5 to 6 years old) children diagnosed with attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder (ADHD). 
METHOD Five- and 6-year-old children attending a summer treatment program between 1987 and 1997 underwent a randomized 
