for evening behavior to assess possible rebound, and side effects ratings were obtained from parents, counselors, and 
teachers. Parents, counselors, and teachers also rated their perceptions of medication status and whether they 
recommended the continued use of the medication given that day. Finally, a clinical team made recommendations for 
